#: cuda.tile._stub.wrapping_add:1 of
msgid "Elementwise integer addition that wraps around on overflow."
msgstr "溢出时回绕的逐元素整数加法。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.wrapping_add.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: cuda.tile._stub.wrapping_add:3 of
msgid "LHS tile."
msgstr "左操作数（LHS）Tile。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.wrapping_add:5 of
msgid "RHS tile."
msgstr "右操作数（RHS）Tile。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.wrapping_add:8 of
msgid ""
"The `shape` of `x` and `y` will be broadcasted. Unlike :func:`add`, the "
"dtypes are not promoted: `x` and `y` must have the same integer dtype, "
"and the result is computed modulo 2**bitwidth of that dtype. A loosely "
"typed constant is converted to the dtype of the other operand, also "
"modulo 2**bitwidth: for example, -1 becomes 255 for uint8."
msgstr ""
"``x`` 和 ``y`` 的 ``shape`` 将会进行广播。与 :func:`add` 不同，本操作不会进行数据类型提升： ``x`` 和 "
"``y`` 必须具有相同的整数数据类型，结果将按该数据类型 ``2**bitwidth`` "
"取模计算。松散类型化常量会转换为另一个操作数的数据类型，并同样按 ``2**bitwidth`` 取模：例如，对于 uint8，-1 将变为 "
"255。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.wrapping_add:13 of
msgid ""
"At least one of the operands must have a concrete dtype, since loosely "
"typed constants don't have a bit width. For example, ``ct.wrapping_add(1,"
" 2)`` is an error, but ``ct.wrapping_add(ct.uint8(150), 110)`` is "
"``ct.uint8(4)``."
msgstr ""
"至少有一个操作数必须具有具体的数据类型（dtype），因为松散类型化常量没有位宽。例如， ``ct.wrapping_add(1, 2)`` "
"会报错，而 ``ct.wrapping_add(ct.uint8(150), 110)`` 的结果为 ``ct.uint8(4)`` 。"

